                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "For the million Marylanders qualifying for Medicare, the #InflationReductionAct ensures you don't have to sacrifice to pay for your lifesaving prescription drugs by:\u00a0\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\ud83e\udd1d Empowering Medicare to negotiate prices\u00a0\n\ud83d\udc8a Capping annual Rx costs at $2K\u00a0\n\ud83d\udcb0 Capping insulin at $35/month",
