                "text": "1 year ago, #Democrats passed the historic #InflationReductionAct. This law cuts the cost of lifesaving Rx drugs by:\n\u00a0\n\ud83d\udc8aAllowing #Medicare to negotiate prices\n\n\ud83c\udfe5Capping out-of-pocket Rx costs at $2k for older adults\n\n\ud83d\udcb2Penalizing #BigPharma for unfairly raising prices https://t.co/3HuSYLKB4I",
