                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I recently sat down with #Maryland members of the National Medical Association as part of their annual health policy colloquium in Washington, D.C. We discussed a wide range of healthcare-related issues, and it was invaluable to receive input from the largest and oldest national organization representing African American physicians and their patients in the United States. \n \n#Healthcare #Health #Medical #Medicine #Doctor #NMAColloquium24",
