                "text": "Today I joined President Joe Biden and Vice President Kamala Harris in Prince George\u2019s County for the announcement of a new Medicare initiative to lower prescription drug prices - a deal which promises to save taxpayers billions of dollars. Thank you, Joe! #JoeBiden #KamalaHarris #Maryland",
