                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I plan to vote hell NO on the MAGA budget scheme that would cut nearly $1 trillion from #Medicaid, undermine veterans\u2019 benefits, and take food away from children and seniors \u2013 while giving tax breaks to billionaires and big corporations.\n \nI stood in defiance with over 200 Members of Congress on the steps of the #USCapitol today to push back against the reckless Trump budget and Elon Musk\u2019s creation: DOGE, the Department of Government EVIL.\n \n#DepartmentofGovernmentEVIL #StopDOGE #RepublicanBudgetScheme #ProtectMedicaid #SupportVeterans #ProtectChildrenandSeniors",
