                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "While you were sleeping, House Republicans in the dead of night, used their voting majority to rip away healthcare, increase everyday costs, and worsen childhood hunger\u2014all to pad the pockets of the super rich.\n\nDespite over 500 amendments from Democrats to fix Trump's \u2018Big Ugly Bill,\u2019 MAGA Republicans refused to compromise and voted to deny Medicaid and Medicare to 14 million Americans. \n\nI proudly voted HELL NO!!! \n\n#PeopleOverProfits\n#FightLikeHell",
