                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "After over 24 hours straight, @HouseDemocrats pulled out all the stops to fight back against the One Big, Ugly Budget Bill because it will:\n\u00a0\n\u274cStrip 17 million people off of their healthcare;\n\u00a0\n\u274cEnact the largest cuts to #Medicaid and food and nutrition services like #SNAP in history, and;\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\u274cCause an estimated 1 in 4 nursing homes to close.\n\u00a0\nI voted a STRONG NO\u2014as I promised the people of our District I would.",
