                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Ensuring that all Americans can afford the current #CostOfLiving must remain at the very top of our priority list. The challenges that we face are daunting \u2013 from stagnant wages and soaring #housing prices to unaffordable #healthcare and rising #grocery costs \u2013 but they are far from insurmountable. \n\n#RaisetheWage #EconomicJustice #Affordability \n\nRead more in my latest op-ed published by The AFRO American Newspapers.\ud83d\udc47\ud83c\udffe\n\nhttps://t.co/joRUft8m7n",
