                "text": "With government funding set to expire tonight at midnight, Democrats are on Capitol Hill and still ready to reach a bipartisan agreement that keeps the government open and lowers the costs for healthcare.\n\nRepublicans refuse to come back to Washington and to do the work that we were all sent here to do. They control the House, the Senate, the White House and the Supreme court and STILL CAN'T GOVERN. Shame! \n\n#CancelTheCuts #LowerTheCosts #SaveHealthcare",
